# Keep the image lean and — critically — keep secrets out of it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
backend/tests
docs
# Node artifacts: the console is built inside the image (stage 1), so a developer's local
# copies must never enter the build context. node_modules in particular holds OS-specific
# binaries — copying a Windows or macOS tree into the Linux build breaks `npm run build`.
**/node_modules
**/dist
